+- Seeded canyon preview and world use the same width and slope functions so changing configuration has a reproducible physical meaning. Geometry is decorative and must not alter the reservoir solver.
+- Action queues are saved explicitly because commands can be issued just before a save; restoring them exactly once avoids losing player commands or duplicating manager purchases.
