+### Directional machine branches and Penstock view
+
+The user's “doesn't make sense” referred to plumbing, not the newly stable selection: “the water passes through the pumps like it's just a line, instead the water should be directed into the turbines (top dow) and the pump should also be sideways and pump it up”. They also said the Penstock camera pointed at the pipe but “there's... absolutely nothing going on”. The previous straight manifold was an explicitly simplified visual and did not meet this requirement.
