+# Bundle review
+
+1. **Browser acceptance — §14.3.** `tests/bundle-smoke.mjs` runs inline code in a Node VM, not a clean offline browser with WebGL. Console errors, rendered styles, worker audit and frame time are unverified. Owner: bundle.
+2. **Bundle method — §11 and bundle brief.** `build/bundle.mjs` replaces unavailable esbuild with an offline static-module transformer; the complete vendor IIFE is inlined without tree shaking/minification. This is functional in the Node smoke check but not the specified build method. Owner: bundle.
+3. **Pacing — §12 Test 24.** `SELFTEST_REPORT.md` records $8.99139/day against $40–120/day; payback 367.948 days is in range. Methodology needs owner review; no constants retuned. Owner: game design.
+
+Verdict: 3 findings.
